# Species profiles

1. Edit `src/content/species/{id}/ka.mdx` **and** `en.mdx`. Folder name = frontmatter `id`.
2. KA owns `id`, taxonomy, `danger`, images, `sources`. EN translates text (credits may overlay).
3. Run `npm run species:compile` (also `predev` / `prebuild`). Never commit or hand-edit `species.generated.ts`.
4. Register in `featuredSpeciesIds` (`src/data/species.ts`) and `speciesAtlasMeta` (`speciesAtlas.ts`).
5. KA slug: `kaToSlug(commonName)` unless `KA_SLUG_OVERRIDES` / `KA_SLUG_ALIASES`.
6. Lookalikes: add both directions in `LOOKALIKES` (`speciesRoutes.ts`). No new YAML keys unless compile reads them.
7. Range map: only if id is in `regions[].speciesIds` — do not list 12 regions in `location` without a source.
8. Placeholders are hidden (`speciesContent.ts`). Skip `stats.სიგრძე` / IUCN / Red List if uncited.
9. IUCN links must be species-specific (`/details/…`), not `https://www.iucnredlist.org/`.
10. Unpublished: `unpublishedSpeciesIds` (currently `dolichophis-caspius`). Keep out of quiz and public profiles.

Reference: `macrovipera-lebetina`, `paralaudakia-caucasia`, `pseudopus-apodus`.
